                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "+ Interesting Idea\n+ Money for content\n\n- Game play is Kind of clunky\n- There's a button that kicks you out of the dungeon without any notice. \n- The starting gun reloads slower than the enemy attacks so you're going to get hit no matter what. \n\n2/5\n\nAn interesting Rogue-Like shooter, made like the old dungeon crawling games. But not executed very well, the poor controls along with the overall game play makes it not that fun of a game for me. If you like this style, maybe give it a try since it's cheap. But you definitely get what you pay for, which in this case is a little disappointing. \n\n[Quote] If you liked this review Make sure to [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/33220185-VR-Games-and-Tools/]Click here[/url] and give a follow for more reviews of good, bad and decent VR titles. And [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/HonestVR/]Click here[/url] if you want to request reviews on other VR titles. [/Quote]",
